<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Virtus Fitness - Premium Gym</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    {{> fragments/navbar}}

    <section class="hero-section" id="inicio">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="container hero-content">
            <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold animate-fade-in-delay">
                <span class="hero-line">Transforma</span>
                <span class="hero-line hero-accent">Tu Cuerpo</span>
                <span class="hero-line">y Mente</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="lead animate-fade-in-delay">Únete a Virtus Fitness y vive la experiencia fitness definitiva</p>
            <div class="hero-buttons animate-fade-in-delay-2">
                {{^isAuthenticated}}<a href="/register" class="btn-primary-cta">Comenzar Ahora <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>{{/isAuthenticated}}
                {{#isAuthenticated}}<a href="/classes" class="btn-primary-cta">Ver Clases <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>{{/isAuthenticated}}
                <a href="#clases" class="btn-secondary-cta">Ver Clases</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ticker-strip">
        <div class="ticker-track">
            <span>Transforma Tu Cuerpo</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>Entrena Con Élite</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>16 Años De Experiencia</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>Únete Ahora</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>1879 Miembros Activos</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>Equipamiento Premium</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>Transforma Tu Cuerpo</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>Entrena Con Élite</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
            <span>16 Años De Experiencia</span><span class="ticker-dot">◆</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="stats-section" id="estadisticas">
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-block stat-item">
                <div class="stat-index">01</div>
                <div class="stat-num-wrap"><h2 class="stat-num" data-count="1879">0</h2><span class="stat-plus">+</span></div>
                <p class="stat-label">Miembros Activos</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-block stat-item">
                <div class="stat-index">02</div>
                <div class="stat-num-wrap"><h2 class="stat-num" data-count="75">0</h2></div>
                <p class="stat-label">Clases Semanales</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-block stat-item">
                <div class="stat-index">03</div>
                <div class="stat-num-wrap"><h2 class="stat-num" data-count="25">0</h2></div>
                <p class="stat-label">Entrenadores</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-block stat-item">
                <div class="stat-index">04</div>
                <div class="stat-num-wrap"><h2 class="stat-num" data-count="16">0</h2></div>
                <p class="stat-label">Años de Experiencia</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="section-title">¿Por Qué Elegir <span class="acc">Virtus?</span></h2>
                <p class="text-muted mt-4">Todo lo que necesitas para alcanzar tus objetivos fitness</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="service-card text-center p-4 shadow-sm rounded">
                        <div class="service-icon mx-auto mb-3"><i class="bi bi-person-workspace text-warning fs-1"></i></div>
                        <h4>Entrenadores Expertos</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">Profesionales certificados dedicados a tu éxito y seguridad</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="service-card text-center p-4 shadow-sm rounded">
                        <div class="service-icon mx-auto mb-3"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check text-warning fs-1"></i></div>
                        <h4>Horarios Flexibles</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">Clases disponibles 7 días a la semana de 9:00 a 21:00</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="service-card text-center p-4 shadow-sm rounded">
                        <div class="service-icon mx-auto mb-3"><i class="bi bi-trophy text-warning fs-1"></i></div>
                        <h4>Equipamiento Premium</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">Última tecnología y equipamiento de gimnasio de máxima calidad</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="popular-classes py-5 bg-light" id="clases">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="section-title">Clases <span class="acc">Populares</span></h2>
                <p class="text-muted mt-4">Descubre nuestros programas fitness más solicitados</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                {{#featuredClasses}}
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card class-card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                        <img src="/images/class/{{id}}" alt="{{name}}" class="card-img-top class-image">
                        <div class="card-body class-body p-4">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                                <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">{{difficulty}}</span>
                                <span class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> {{durationText}}</span>
                            </div>
                            <h5>{{name}}</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-3">{{shortDescription}}</p>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <a href="/classes/{{id}}" class="btn btn-dark btn-sm">Más Información</a>
                                {{#isAuthenticated}}
                                <form action="/classes/{{id}}/book" method="post">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="{{csrfParameterName}}" value="{{csrfToken}}">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i> Reservar</button>
                                </form>
                                {{/isAuthenticated}}
                                {{^isAuthenticated}}
                                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i> Reservar</a>
                                {{/isAuthenticated}}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/featuredClasses}}
            </div>
            <div class="text-center mt-4">
                <a href="/classes" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg">Ver Todas las Clases</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials-section py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="section-title">Lo Que Dicen <span class="acc">Nuestros Miembros</span></h2>
                <p class="text-muted mt-4">Historias reales de transformación</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="testimonial-card p-4"><div class="stars mb-3 text-warning"><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i></div><p class="testimonial-text">"Virtus Fitness cambió mi vida. ¡He perdido 15kg en 6 meses!"</p><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>María García</strong><small class="text-muted d-block">Miembro desde 2023</small></div></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="testimonial-card p-4"><div class="stars mb-3 text-warning"><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i></div><p class="testimonial-text">"Las clases de CrossFit son desafiantes pero adictivas. ¡100% recomendado!"</p><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Carlos Ruiz</strong><small class="text-muted d-block">Miembro desde 2022</small></div></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="testimonial-card p-4"><div class="stars mb-3 text-warning"><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i></div><p class="testimonial-text">"El yoga aquí es transformador. Los instructores son maravillosos."</p><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Laura Martínez</strong><small class="text-muted d-block">Miembro desde 2024</small></div></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="newsletter-section py-5 bg-dark text-white">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-center">
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 mb-md-0">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-2">¿Listo para empezar tu transformación?</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">Únete a más de 1879 miembros que ya han cambiado sus vidas</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 text-md-end">
                    {{^isAuthenticated}}<a href="/register" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold px-5">Comenzar Ahora</a>{{/isAuthenticated}}
                    {{#isAuthenticated}}<a href="/classes" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold px-5">Ver Clases</a>{{/isAuthenticated}}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {{> fragments/footer}}

    <button id="backToTop" class="btn btn-warning rounded-circle shadow" title="Volver arriba"><i class="bi bi-arrow-up"></i></button>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
